{"id":"vod_bf_13070","vodId":"13070","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"黑之契约者","name_cn":"黑之契约者","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-14/17ca255c2cfeafa2774d102d01bffffd.jpg"},"summary":"随着“地狱之门”的出现，美丽的星空被掩盖，取而代之的是用来监视“契约者”行动的虚假星空。“契约者”是接触了“地狱之门”里的物质后，获得超能力的人。作为被选中的人群，他们冷酷、无情，让人充满畏惧与疑惑。各种神秘组织为了自身利益，利用契约者的超能力展开混战。　　本来不是契约者的黑，为了妹妹白，不得不违背自己的意志加入战斗，并与契约者琥珀相爱。可是他渐渐发现琥珀背叛了组织，也背叛了自己；在神秘事件后妹妹也失去踪迹。愤怒的黑终于成为真正的契约者，被人称为黑色死神，被诅咒的契约者。　　在执行组织任务中黑再次遇到琥珀，而琥珀的言行愈加充满神秘，似乎背叛之下有着许多难言之隐。为了找到妹妹，黑追踪着琥珀，渐渐的看到混战背后更大的秘密。黑能否找到妹妹呢？他该为自己和契约者的命运做出怎样的抉择？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:59:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022EGG0BLv6index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022yMuDeNuRindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410225JR9YC8hindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022FeosZcShindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022Awm7i6r9index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022VGQwXjHzindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022bdFOwAt3index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410229bmtv5oPindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/2024102